$* bracketPML / escaping - probe: check the text rules in YOUR E3D.
$* Stand on one test element that has a DESC (EQUI, SUBE, CWBRAN). Paste as Macro.
$* Everything is written under a rollback mark and undone by UNDODB.
$* Do not SAVEWORK while it runs. Compare each Q DESC answer with the expected text.
MARKDB |bracketPML escaping probe|
$P expected: Description cable tray 600
DESC |cable tray 600|
Q DESC
$P expected: Description price $$5  (one dollar sign)
DESC |price $$5|
Q DESC
$P expected: Description 3/4" pipe
DESC |3/4" pipe|
Q DESC
$P expected: Description single quotes work too
DESC 'single quotes work too'
Q DESC
UNDODB
$P after UNDODB the description is back to what it was:
Q DESC
$P NOT YET VERIFIED BY US: a vertical bar inside single quotes. Expected: Description a, bar, b
$P If this line fails, nothing was written - tell us the error text.
MARKDB |bracketPML escaping probe 2|
DESC 'a|b'
Q DESC
UNDODB
Q DESC
